 of {detri}, and unfortunately it was used for a while before anyone notice=
d that it conflicts with the official {tatru}. Disrupting usage is bad, but=
 leaving a flagrant violation of our own rules in the lexicon is worse, so =
I've just added {datro} to la jbovlaste as a replacement.

I left a note in the notes of both words. Since there is=C2=A0usage=C2=A0of=
 {datru}, we shouldn't necessarily downvote it so hard that it disappears f=
rom dictionaries... but on the other hand, dictionaries with working full-t=
ext search will come up with {datro} anyway.

